# `delete save`, and the consequence two screens away.
#
# **This is the pair of `continue-is-offered-once-a-game-has-been-saved`** - that one says the item
# appears, this one says it goes. **Two tests rather than one** because what makes `continue`
# conditional is the condition changing in both directions.

{test name:deleting-the-last-save-takes-continue-off-the-menu}

{given}
{screen name:saves}
{save name:first-game turn:3} -> 1

{when}
{delete-save name:first-game}

{then}
{screen name:saves}
{item of:saves name:start active:0} -> 1
{item of:saves name:back active:1} -> 1
{attention of:back}
